# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working copy.
#
# Why this file exists: a developer machine here had core.autocrlf=true, which
# rewrites working-copy files to CRLF on checkout. That fights two things this
# project already enforces - .editorconfig (end_of_line = lf) and Pint's
# line_ending fixer - so a clone would arrive with files that the formatter
# immediately wants to change. Setting it here makes the repository the
# authority instead of whatever each machine happens to be configured with.
*        text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must never be treated as text. text=auto detects most binaries on
# content, but being explicit means a corrupted checkout is not one bad guess
# away - a .wasm mangled by newline translation fails at runtime, not at build.
*.docx   binary
*.wasm   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ico    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
